# ============================================================
#  Unity .gitignore  (last day / prototype project)
# ============================================================

# ---------- Unity generated folders ----------
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Asset meta files must be committed, except when the asset itself is ignored.
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# ---------- Autogenerated / IDE ----------
/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---------- Build outputs ----------
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app
*.exe
*.dll.mdb

# ---------- Addressables ----------
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# ============================================================
#  Project-specific exclusions
# ============================================================

# Large in-project snapshot taken before the cleanup. It contains a full
# copy of the third-party extracted assets plus an unverified marker file,
# so it must never be committed.
/.baseline-backups/

# Analysis / review artefacts: generated reports, backup folders and
# copied managed DLLs. Reproducible, not source.
# Maintained helpers and exact historical script archives live under /Tools/.
# Legacy loose .cjs files here remain ignored; see Tools/Validation/README.md.
#
# 【这条规则改过 —— 原写法会把测试源码也挡在库外】
# 原先是直接排除整个目录：/OptimizationReview/
# 于是 check_*.py 和两个测试工程（约 2600 条断言）都不受版本控制，
# 换一台机器就全没了。而"代码还在、但没有任何东西能证明它还对"
# 比丢资产更难察觉 —— 所以测试源码必须入库。
#
# 注意 Git 的规则：父目录被排除时，内部任何取反（!）都不生效。
# 所以不能"排除整目录再放行子目录"，只能排除"目录下的每一项"再逐项放行。
/OptimizationReview/*
!/OptimizationReview/README.md
!/OptimizationReview/*.py

# 维护中的测试工程（源码）。其余子目录（backup-* / *-backup-* / validation）
# 合计约 53 MB 的历史快照，继续保持排除。
!/OptimizationReview/StairSnapChecks/
!/OptimizationReview/SkyMathChecks/

# 测试工程的构建产物仍然排除（必须写在目录放行之后才生效）
/OptimizationReview/StairSnapChecks/bin/
/OptimizationReview/StairSnapChecks/obj/
/OptimizationReview/SkyMathChecks/bin/
/OptimizationReview/SkyMathChecks/obj/

# 覆盖上面的全局 "*.csproj" 规则：测试工程的工程文件必须入库，
# 否则换机器 .csproj 缺失，剩下的 .cs 无法编译，测试等于没有。
!/OptimizationReview/StairSnapChecks/*.csproj
!/OptimizationReview/SkyMathChecks/*.csproj

# ============================================================
#  Third-party extracted assets
# ============================================================
# The extracted FBX/PNG set has been moved out of the project into an
# external quarantine, so the eight model folders no longer contain any
# third-party content. They are normal project locations again and future
# self-made or licensed models MUST be tracked there.
#
# IMPORTANT - do not re-add a blanket "*.fbx" rule for these folders.
# A blanket rule makes a model show up in Unity while silently staying out
# of version control, so a fresh clone on another machine would be missing
# every model. If a specific third-party file ever has to be excluded,
# list that exact file name instead of the extension.
#
# The only location kept isolated is the dedicated extracted-texture dump,
# which exists purely for third-party source images. Nothing inside it is
# meant to be committed, including the .meta files (otherwise a re-import
# would leave orphan .meta entries in the repository).
/Assets/_Project/Art/Textures/Extracted/*
/Assets/_Project/Art/Textures/Extracted_manifest.json
/Assets/_Project/Art/Textures/Extracted_manifest.json.meta
